     10087           2               2   True
violations: 0

  So the INFINITE all-ones word -- 0-confined, Delta_N = (alpha-1)N -> infinity --
  is realizable by NO positive integer: every positive m_0 leaves it after
  v_2(m_0+1) - 1 steps.  Its only 2-adic realizer is -1 = 111..., with T(-1) = -1.
  This is the brief's warning control: a 0-confined symbolic word with
  arbitrarily large linear deficit need not come from a positive seed at all.

